  "description": "An idiomatic, immutable, fluent C# wrapper over Kookerella.FsOpenXmlDsl - build and read Excel workbooks (.xlsx/.xlsm) from C# without touching F# discriminated unions or option types directly. Covers every feature the F# core models: cell values/formulas, styling (incl. per-cell lock/hide protection), merged ranges/freeze panes/autofilter, Excel Tables, charts, images, pivot tables, sparklines, conditional formatting, data validation, hyperlinks, comments, print settings, defined names, sheet/workbook protection, VBA (as opaque bytes), and code generation.",
